#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Dependencies live here rather than in help.deps: asdf 0.16+ stops after help.deps when it
# exists, so help.links would never be printed.

cat <<'TEXT'
stringer generates String() methods for Go integer constants (golang.org/x/tools/cmd/stringer).

stringer publishes no binaries, so this plugin builds it from source with the Go version that is
active where you run asdf install. Versions are golang.org/x/tools tags without the leading v,
for example: stringer 0.49.0

Dependencies: Go, active in the directory where you run asdf install. With asdf:

  asdf plugin add golang && asdf install golang <version>

and list golang before stringer in .tool-versions.

golang.org/x/tools 0.50.0 and later need Go 1.26 or newer; 0.49.0 needs Go 1.25.
The plugin never downloads another Go toolchain: on an older Go the install fails.

TEXT
